    "Recommended private-key format: OpenSSH Ed25519 with a passphrase, created by ssh-keygen above. Remodex also accepts encrypted PKCS#8 and encrypted legacy PEM keys; unencrypted keys work only if you explicitly enable that option on the profile. In Remodex, use the Windows username, PC IPv4 address, port 22, and the matching private key. Administrator accounts use C:\\ProgramData\\ssh\\administrators_authorized_keys instead.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recommended private-key format: OpenSSH Ed25519 with a passphrase, created by ssh-keygen above. Remodex also accepts encrypted PKCS#8 and encrypted legacy PEM keys; unencrypted keys work only if you explicitly enable that option on the profile. In Remodex, use the Windows username, PC IPv4 address, port 22, and the matching private key. Administrator accounts use C:\\ProgramData\\ssh\\administrators_authorized_keys instead."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "推荐使用带口令的 OpenSSH Ed25519 私钥。Remodex 也支持加密的 PKCS#8 和旧版 PEM；只有在配置中明确允许后才接受未加密密钥。填写 Windows 用户名、电脑 IPv4 地址、22 端口和对应私钥。管理员账号使用 C:\\ProgramData\\ssh\\administrators_authorized_keys。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
