            "value": "设备拒绝 SSH 连接，请开启远程登录并确认终端端口正确。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The QR remains available as a recovery path if trust changes or the session can't be resolved.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
